ge  and rode off into the sunset building  with frank a new home in hambrook's bay  maryland danny had saved enough money  and now got to enjoy her twilight years  in peace by 1926 both she and frank  butler were in poor health she was  suffering from a blood disorder called  pernicious anemia annie oakley died on  the 3rd of november 1926 age 66 frank  died 18 days later and was buried next  to his wife of 50 years  [Music]  you
 

